{
 "about": "Which components wear which felt piece. Every pill, tile and chip is the same stitched shape in many colours, so colour carries meaning: each mode has its own, the word pair changes colour every move, and actions are colour-coded. scripts/build.mjs turns this into CSS (later entries win at equal specificity). Images: src/client/felt/<asset>.webp from scripts/build-felt-assets.py. Each component sets --felt-h, the height its piece is drawn at.",
